        "en": "Explanation"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.honesty-guidance-explanation",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Kejujuran menyatukan ucapan, tindakan, dan keadaan sebenarnya serta membangun kepercayaan.",
        "en": "Honesty aligns speech and action with reality and builds trust."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.honesty-guidance-example-heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": {
        "id": "Contoh dalam kehidupan",
        "en": "Life example"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.honesty-guidance-example",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Seseorang mengakui kesalahan dalam tugas dan memperbaikinya tanpa menyalahkan orang lain.",
        "en": "A person admits a mistake in a task and corrects it without blaming others."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.honesty-guidance-action-heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": {
        "id": "Langkah tindakan",
        "en": "Action step"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.honesty-guidance-action",
      "type": "steps",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "step.honesty-guidance-action",
          "title": {
            "id": "Praktikkan",
            "en": "Put it into practice"
          },
          "body": {
            "id": "Sampaikan satu fakta sulit dengan benar, lembut, dan tanpa melebihkan atau mengurangi.",
            "en": "Communicate one difficult fact truthfully, gently, and without exaggeration or concealment."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
